.TH LIBMPQ__ARCHIVE_RAW_CHUNK_SIZE_GET 3 2026-11-03 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__archive_raw_chunk_size_get \- query archive raw-MD5 chunk size
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__archive_raw_chunk_size_get("
.BI "        mpq_archive_s *" "archive,"
.BI "        uint32_t *" "raw_chunk_size"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Query the configured size on writable archives or the stored v4 header size
on readers. MPQ v1/v2/v3 return zero. Use libmpq__archive_version(3) to distinguish
older formats from v4 with disabled raw arrays. This operation is read-only;
it does not verify checksums or prove their availability.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Return 0 on success or a negative libmpq error code.
The output is cleared on failure when its pointer is valid.
.SH ERRORS
Missing required pointers return LIBMPQ_ERROR_EXIST.
Invalid archive generations return LIBMPQ_ERROR_FORMAT.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq (3),
.BR libmpq__archive_create (3),
.BR libmpq__archive_create_mpqe (3),
.BR libmpq__archive_raw_chunk_size_set (3),
.BR libmpq__patch_raw_chunk_size_set (3),
.BR libmpq__patch_raw_chunk_size_get (3),
.BR libmpq__archive_sign (3),
.BR libmpq__file_verify (3)
